    "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded from epilepsy patients undergoing clinical monitoring for seizure localization. Subjects completed five sessions of the Speed Match visuomotor task on the Lumosity platform during interictal EEG recording. Raw iEEG data were acquired in .edf format with channel details provided in accompanying .tsv files. Trial timing information, including start and end samples for finger tapping events, was annotated in the iEEG recordings.",
